# RIMSHIRE: an adder with a star kills with its first bite.
game rimshire
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat army 0 A
cheat army 1 W
cheat battle 6 1 0
cheat field 0
cheat place 0 100 128
cheat place 1 150 128
cheat stars 0 1
waituntil bphase == 1 200
press A
hold RIGHT 40
hold A 12
wait 1
waituntil moving == 0 600
expect d1_on == 0
